        "original_id": "eca2b058-717b-5ffb-94ee-73c4f84d309e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Casado con hijos, Married... with Children, Liberty's Kids, WKRP in Cincinnati, Full House, Mike Hammer\n- People: Michael G. Moye, Ron Leavitt, Doug McIntyre\n- Companies: Fox\n- Topics: television series remakes, television writing and production, local politics, jazz, the Great American Songbook, Humanitas Prize\n\nFacts:\n- Married... with Children is an American television sitcom that aired on Fox and was created by Michael G. Moye and Ron Leavitt.\n- Casado con hijos is a Chilean television series and a remake of the American television show Married... with Children.\n- Casado con hijos aired on May 2, 2006, and ended on October 15, 2008.\n- Doug McIntyre worked as a television writer-producer on Married... with Children, WKRP in Cincinnati, Full House, Mike Hammer, and the PBS series Liberty's Kids.\n- Liberty's Kids earned Doug McIntyre a Humanitas Prize nomination.\n- Doug McIntyre is known for active involvement in local politics and for a passion for jazz and the Great American Songbook.",
